<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  mbnavedit.ui - the interactive navigation editor window (port of MB-System's mbnavedit,
  mbnavedit.uil / mbnavedit_creation.c). Loaded at RUNTIME by deps/src/mbnavedit/mbnavedit_window.cpp
  (QUiLoader). The objectNames are the Motif widget names; every one is looked up by name there, so
  rename one and the tool refuses to open, naming the missing widget.
  Absolute geometry, no layouts: only the plot area (scrollArea) follows the window's size, from
  code, as mbnavedit's do_resize made the scrolled window follow the bulletin board.
-->
